     "Consolidate fragmented tools behind a unified enterprise interface, pause concurrent rollouts, and institute a Wave-Based Adoption Cadence that allows each cohort time to master one high-impact workflow, realize tangible relief, and stabilize before introducing subsequent capabilities",
